{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grinding Guilds mixes Auto Battler with RPG elements. Assemble your team, battle hordes of enemies, create unique builds with multiple abilities. Get loot, craft powerful items and grind your way against increasingly harder enemies to reclaim all regions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Active and Auto mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of your hero and lead your guild to victory, or sit back and watch them battle hordes of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299780/extras/Gif_Combat-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1745346512\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Assemble your guild</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens of allies with unique abilities to choose from and create your party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299780/extras/Hiring.png?t=1745346512\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Equip your units</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each unit can be equipped with up to 6 items that greatly modify their stats. 4 extra slots can be equipped with powerful Pacts that can provide benefits to the whole party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299780/extras/Gif_Equiping-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1745346512\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Skill trees</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up your abilities and customize them. Each ability has its own skill tree with multiple upgrades for you to create amazing builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299780/extras/Gif_Skill_Tree-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1745346512\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your battles, defeating a boss region will unlock new crafting recipes and new allies. Grind your way against increasingly harder enemies, defeat all bosses and reclaim all regions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299780/extras/Zone_Selection.png?t=1745346512\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3299780?t=1745346512","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3299780?t=1745346512","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299780/e0b57e502a660835dea50afbb58ab54609a2153b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745346512","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299780/e0b57e502a660835dea50afbb58ab54609a2153b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745346512","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grinding Guilds mixes Auto Battler with RPG elements. Assemble your team, battle hordes of enemies, create unique builds with multiple abilities. Get loot, craft powerful items and grind your way against increasingly harder enemies to reclaim all regions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Active and Auto mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of your hero and lead your guild to victory, or sit back and watch them battle hordes of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299780/extras/Gif_Combat-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1745346512\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Assemble your guild</h2><p class=\"bb_parag